e connections to emperors  of the past  are in danger it's going to be up to you  and an old friend evely sharparo to  discover what exactly is going on in  blackwood  now there's a lot more to see and  explore in leon when blackwood launches  for now though let's travel to a place  folks haven't visited since 1994's arena  gideon now we're going to need to be on  high alert as we make our way to the  city  well gideon itself is a safe haven the  ruined ayleid outskirts are quite  dangerous  you'll need to be on the lookout for the  dangerous creatures roaming the swamps  like my new favorite monsters the bog  dogs and death hoppers  those aren't the only things you'll need  to watch out for either the restless  spirits that haunt the ruins of castle  geovese  a landmark that should be familiar to  those who have read the lore book 2920  are nearby as well for now though let's  continue into the city of gideon  though the city may look imperial its  leadership and rulers are anything but  led by the great keshu of the blackfin  legion gideon has been turned into a  home for not only the argonians who have  left the dark swamps of the black marsh  but for many travelers from the lands  around the area  in addition to the major cities of  blackwood there's tons of other  locations to explore as well  both familiar and new places like  undertow caverns  beyond ruins and border watch will all  be familiar but different  there's also places like arpenia  deepscoring hollow and blood run cave  each with their own unique stories to  tell you're also going to want to keep  an eye out for some familiar faces here  too  there might just be an archaeologist and  her manservant stumbling into some  trouble again  oh and perhaps a band of masked actors  from somerset as well  next up we're going to dance with some  daedra in the deadlines but before we do  a quick word from our sponsors  wow there is a lot to look forward to in  blackwood  there are a ton of great in-game events